<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AI Platform Account &amp; Credential List (Template)</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: dark; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; padding: 32px 20px; background: #0d1117; color: #c9d1d9;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; }
  h1 { font-size: 26px; color: #e6edf3; border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d; padding-bottom: 12px; }
  h2 { font-size: 19px; color: #58a6ff; margin-top: 32px; }
  .warn {
    background: rgba(248,81,73,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(248,81,73,0.4);
    color: #ff7b72; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 12px 0; font-size: 14px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #30363d; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; }
  th { background: #161b22; color: #e6edf3; }
  td { background: #0d1117; }
  code {
    background: #161b22; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1px 6px; font-family: "Consolas", "Monaco", monospace;
    color: #79c0ff; font-size: 13px;
  }
  .ph { color: #d29922; }   /* placeholder */
  .note { color: #8b949e; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 24px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>🔐 AI Platform Account &amp; Credential List (Template)</h1>
  <div class="warn">⚠️ This is a <b>template</b>. Replace every <span class="ph">yellow placeholder</span> with a real value. <b>After filling it in, keep it safe and never commit it to any code repository.</b></div>

  <p class="note">How to use: during deployment, fill your actual accounts / passwords / keys into the placeholders below. Each placeholder (e.g. <code>CHANGE_ME_STRONG_PASSWORD</code>) corresponds to a variable in <code>.env.example</code>.</p>

  <h2>1. Unified Admin Account (Core)</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Item</th><th>Value</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Unified username</td><td><code class="ph">your-admin-username</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Unified password (application layer)</td><td><code class="ph">CHANGE_ME_STRONG_PASSWORD</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Admin email</td><td><code class="ph">admin@example.com</code></td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>2. Per-Platform Admin Accounts</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Platform</th><th>Username</th><th>Password</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Keycloak</td><td><code class="ph">your-admin-username</code></td><td><code class="ph">CHANGE_ME_STRONG_PASSWORD</code></td><td>Master Realm admin</td></tr>
    <tr><td>NewAPI</td><td><code class="ph">your-admin-username</code></td><td><code class="ph">CHANGE_ME_STRONG_PASSWORD</code></td><td>Root admin (role=100)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>AI Admin Center</td><td><code class="ph">your-admin-username</code></td><td><code class="ph">CHANGE_ME_STRONG_PASSWORD</code></td><td>Global Admin</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Ghost</td><td><code class="ph">admin@example.com</code></td><td><code class="ph">CHANGE_ME_STRONG_PASSWORD</code></td><td>Passwordless login (email code); created via setup wizard</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Gitea</td><td><code class="ph">your-admin-username</code></td><td><code class="ph">CHANGE_ME_STRONG_PASSWORD</code></td><td>Created during the install wizard</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Dify</td><td><code class="ph">admin@example.com</code></td><td><code class="ph">CHANGE_ME_STRONG_PASSWORD</code></td><td>Created via email on first visit</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>3. AD Domain Account (LDAP Bind)</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Item</th><th>Value</th></tr>
    <tr><td>sAMAccountName</td><td><code class="ph">your-admin-username</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Display name (CN, with spaces)</td><td><code class="ph">your display name (spaces allowed)</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Password</td><td><code class="ph">CHANGE_ME_STRONG_PASSWORD</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Bind DN</td><td><code class="ph">CN=your display name,CN=Users,DC=company,DC=local</code></td></tr>
  </table>
  <p class="note">⚠️ The LDAP bindDn uses the CN with spaces (your display name), not underscores.</p>

  <h2>4. Service Keys &amp; Database Passwords</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Item</th><th>Value</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
    <tr><td>NewAPI MySQL password</td><td><code class="ph">CHANGE_ME_STRONG_PASSWORD</code></td><td>NEWAPI_DB_PASSWORD</td></tr>
    <tr><td>NewAPI Session Secret</td><td><code class="ph">change-me-to-random-string</code></td><td>NEWAPI_SESSION_SECRET</td></tr>
    <tr><td>NewAPI Crypto Secret</td><td><code class="ph">change-me-to-random-string</code></td><td>NEWAPI_CRYPTO_SECRET</td></tr>
    <tr><td>LiteLLM Master Key</td><td><code class="ph">sk-litellm-CHANGE_ME</code></td><td>Used by NewAPI to connect LiteLLM</td></tr>
    <tr><td>DeepSeek API Key</td><td><code class="ph">sk-your-deepseek-key-here</code></td><td>External LLM key</td></tr>
    <tr><td>AI Admin Center Session Secret</td><td><code class="ph">change-me-to-random-string</code></td><td>SESSION_SECRET</td></tr>
    <tr><td>MCP Admin API Token</td><td><code class="ph">change-me-mcp-admin-token</code></td><td>MCP_ADMIN_TOKEN</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>5. Keycloak OIDC Client Secrets</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Client</th><th>Secret</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
    <tr><td>newapi</td><td><code class="ph">change-me-newapi-oidc-secret</code></td><td>For NewAPI Keycloak SSO</td></tr>
    <tr><td>AI-all-in-one-admin-portal</td><td><code class="ph">change-me-keycloak-client-secret</code></td><td>For AI Admin Center Keycloak SSO</td></tr>
  </table>

  <p class="note">Template generated: 2026-08-14 · Host LAN IP: <code class="ph">your LAN IP (SERVER_IP in .env)</code></p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
